/Basic Subroutine (Part 1)
/Convert the code, from the previous task, to a subroutine, 
/and create a main program to accept any number from the user (via keyboard), 
/if it is “zero” exit the program, 
/otherwise call the subroutine to double it and display.
 
/main program
Loop,   Input
        Store X
        SkipCond 400    /等于0时，跳过下一个指令
        Jump process
        Halt

process,    Jns double
            Jump Loop

/subroutine
double,     dec 0
            Load X
            Add X
            Store X
            Output
            JumpI double

X,      dec 0